  [PASS] P2-confound (an assertion that CAN fail; it PASSES, which means the confound is real) -- support type and MASS are CONFOUNDED across these eight rows: the pressure-supported systems here are also the massive ones.  The pattern cannot be attributed to support alone   (pressure rows span 9.9e+10 - 1.9e+11 Msun; rotation rows 7.6e+08 - 6.7e+10.  The ONLY row pair that separates the two is the Milky Way (6.7e+10 Msun, rotation, -0.115) against the Fundamental Plane (9.9e+10 Msun, pressure, +0.109) -- comparable mass, opposite sign.  One pair is not a demonstration)

